                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f244c783-0814-32ec-b55d-e781b58d7a5e",
                        "entry_id": "23c7cec1-aae8-39e8-a03a-d1f8df6ce0b4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To study the geology of a location in the field."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c8cb0af0-23b4-44b1-a0c5-40755d306254",
                                "sense_id": "f244c783-0814-32ec-b55d-e781b58d7a5e",
                                "text": "...those many valuable writers, who have unwisely lent their science to uphold and propagate the vicious doctrine of a chaotic geogeny, may geologize with full security..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "13c4b796-e1f7-4150-b731-e81b22bbc9b5",
                                "sense_id": "f244c783-0814-32ec-b55d-e781b58d7a5e",
                                "text": "We travel here in an extraordinary manner, but we cannot geologize by steam-boats."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8c5949c2-312a-4c2d-8b05-ca7fc9d3f17f",
                                "sense_id": "f244c783-0814-32ec-b55d-e781b58d7a5e",
                                "text": "We continued northwards in a zigzag line; sometimes stopping a day to geologize."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ba938877-8f08-4fab-a0a0-2e3449f52e5e",
                                "sense_id": "f244c783-0814-32ec-b55d-e781b58d7a5e",
                                "text": "There was a certain wood, which, by rising at early morn, and taking the cheap train, I could reach at eleven in the morning. Here I would botanize or geologize at my will."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f4dbf28b-3e42-4946-8cbb-90c685af75dd",
                                "sense_id": "f244c783-0814-32ec-b55d-e781b58d7a5e",
                                "text": "...and ploughmen will botanize or geologize on their way home from their daily toil..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ca924050-fc5b-4000-939b-2f30042b9e85",
                                "sense_id": "f244c783-0814-32ec-b55d-e781b58d7a5e",
                                "text": "And between the intervals of eating fruit, we will geologize on the way home, with this little bit of paper to show us where we are."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1e06d9aa-3112-4354-8694-b00a704bccbb",
                                "sense_id": "f244c783-0814-32ec-b55d-e781b58d7a5e",
                                "text": "Scott presumably foresaw this, which may explain his decision to geologize on the return trip once he lost priority at the pole."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
